<p>Thank you, Taffeta - I'm pleased that you enjoyed it, and that you felt it was sufficiently representative of what I was trying to do. Without underselling the amount of work that went into this, it was enjoyable to write in a way that writing isn't always - anyone who likes setting up dominoes, then watching them fall, will get what I mean.</p>
