<p>As a joyless nitpicker myself, I object to that sentiment! :)</p>
<p>Or perhaps I can put it this way: &quot;I'm a joyless nitpicker, and I vote.&quot;</p>
<p>That said, I think you've absolutely skewered me on part of why I added that ending in. And seeing my motives exposed like that does incline me somewhat to removing it. That said, I would be interested in hearing from anyone with the contrary view - do you prefer the piece ending with the final addendum? Would it change your vote if it was removed?</p>

